          deckDescription: "Standard 52-card French deck; no jokers. In Pishe Pasha the pack is shuffled and each player gets a face-down stock of 26 cards. Cards are played to foundation piles (A-K in each suit) or onto the opponent's discard (next higher or lower rank).",
